Z||000000||Oreif||06-23-2001||12:17 AM||||A friend had a problem with his steering being hard. Very hard. This is what we found!<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Cracrak.jpg">   <P>Yes the Rack was cracked! We swapped in a new rack with new tie rod ends. Only broke one bolt.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Anyhow another Fiero can steer better tonight.<P>BTW ~ Anyone doing work on a fiero, you need to have Haze as the supervisor. He does an excellent job!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">      <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B><P><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 06-23-2001).]||||reg||12
Z||000001||starfighter007@msn.com||06-23-2001||12:34 AM||||aye caramba looks like you could go from hard steering to gulp no steering I need to have a looksie at my rack tommorow thanks for the info||||reg||11
Z||000002||Fierowrecker||06-23-2001||01:29 AM||||Hey Oreif!<BR>Is that from corrosion or impact??<BR>can't tell from the pic, but looks like corrosion?<BR>crash...||||reg||1
Z||000003||Oreif||06-23-2001||01:35 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fierowrecker:<BR><B>Hey Oreif!<BR>Is that from corrosion or impact??<BR>can't tell from the pic, but looks like corrosion?<BR>crash...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>It started from impact and corroded over time. We are not sure how long it was like that but it was driven daily and on the highways a few times before the damage was noticed.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>No the present owner was not the one who crashed it. The car was bought with the damage and we are in the process of repairing it. It was reported that someone backed into the car but further visual inspection looks like someone jumped a curb or ran over something big.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000004||theogre||06-23-2001||12:41 PM||||But don't they all look that way?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <P>That's nasty glad it didn't hang up and cause a wreck.||||reg||1
