Z||000006||XDrewX||06-24-2001||10:54 PM||||INCREDIBLE !!!<P>I have always wondered if my steering was too hard.<P>Lets put it this way, i cant let my wife drive the car.  <P>It takes alot of muscle to turn the steering wheel at less than 3 miles per hour.<BR>Must use two hands on all 90 degree turns.<P>But on the highway its like having power steering.  <P>It is too dark to get under the car now, but I was wondering is everyones steering pretty hard at low speed, and are there any other things that could be wrong that i should look for that would lead to hard steering.<P>I have only had the car for about 3 weeks, so I dont know if the steering is normal.<P>I had other cars with "manual" steering, but they did not feel this hard.<P>Tire pressure is perfect. (got my new digital pressure guage)<P>sorry post is so long.<BR>||||reg||1
